      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WINTER BLOOM (8) was fast away from wide out with an impressive early sectional and went on to clock 22.43 in a 6 length win at this track over 400m. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Hard to go past. JILLIBY EATON (1) has missed the frame at her last two but did run well three back when third (22.71) in a Grade 5 at this track. Has the ability and expected to do much better. ARCHIE THOMAS (7) has a strong record here with two wins and a minor from five starts. Comes off a (22.64) win last time, scoring by half a length in a Grade 5 over 400m at this track. With even luck and a clean start should be thereabouts. BOLD CHARM (2) gets a chance to improve on an unplaced run at her latest outing at this circuit.",
